# The raw dumps are gigabytes and fully reproducible from the tool + the committed
# result.json, so they are not tracked:
#
#   runs/<tag>/seq/          logits_*.bin, state_*.bin, out.log, ids.txt
#   runs/<tag>/block/        the same for the candidate path
#
# What IS tracked, per run, is result.json: the fixture, the gate, every metric and every
# verdict. That is what a reviewer or a test reads; the bytes can always be regenerated.
runs/*/seq/
runs/*/block/
